message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "FluxyLogger: open-source modular Arduino datalogger for environmental monitoring and cave air tracing"
abstract: >-
  FluxyLogger is an open-source modular datalogger platform based on Arduino UNO
  for environmental monitoring, originally developed for cave air tracing studies.
  The firmware supports the NASO (MQ-2 gas sensor), NASO+LCD, METEO (BMP280 and
  anemometer) and VOC (SGP40/SGP30) configurations, logging CSV data on a microSD
  card with RTC timestamps.
